WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.133 --> 00:00:00.767
Want to take you now

00:00:00.767 --> 00:00:01.434
live to Disney

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:02.135
Pro and CNN's

00:00:02.135 --> 00:00:02.869
Sam Kiley,

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:04.571
who's been following this for us.

00:00:04.571 --> 00:00:05.839
Sam, describe the scene.

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:07.874
What are you seeing behind you?

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:12.045
Well, Boris, it's 11 hours

00:00:12.045 --> 00:00:14.681
since whatever hit this medical clinic

00:00:15.215 --> 00:00:16.016
did that.

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:18.184
Now, a good deal of the front

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:18.852
part of this

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:20.253
building has been taken down

00:00:20.253 --> 00:00:23.423
by these diggers and cranes.

00:00:23.423 --> 00:00:24.991
But you can see also

00:00:24.991 --> 00:00:26.326
there are hope you can make it out.

00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:28.728
They're still spraying water into that.

00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:29.562
They're actually

00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:31.598
collecting burning debris,

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:34.934
putting the fire out and then

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:37.070
taking it away in dumpsters now.

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:38.338
Two people were killed here.

00:00:38.338 --> 00:00:40.106
The local authorities are saying

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:40.874
that's nothing

00:00:40.874 --> 00:00:41.775
short of a miracle

00:00:41.775 --> 00:00:42.742
because

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:44.711
they could have been much, much worse.

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:46.713
But the numbers in this clinic were down

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:48.915
because one medical shift had left

00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:50.150
and the other medical shift

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:51.151
hadn't got underway.

00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:52.285
So there were fewer people here,

00:00:52.285 --> 00:00:53.853
but the majority of people in that

00:00:53.853 --> 00:00:55.388
there were injured.

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:56.589
In terms of a profession,

00:00:56.589 --> 00:00:57.690
certainly there are six doctors

00:00:57.690 --> 00:00:57.991
at least

00:00:57.991 --> 00:00:59.125
that were injured in there, two

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:01.961
people killed, a total of 30 people

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:04.531
injured in what was,

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:05.465
according to the World

00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:07.500
Health Organization,

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.769
There has been a systematic targeting of

00:01:09.869 --> 00:01:12.105
of medical facilities and medics

00:01:12.105 --> 00:01:13.373
across the country

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:14.340
throughout this war

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:16.109
with nearly a thousand

00:01:16.109 --> 00:01:18.244
occasions been recorded by the World

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:19.279
Health World Health

00:01:19.279 --> 00:01:20.747
Organization excuse me.

00:01:20.747 --> 00:01:21.514
And we saw, of course,

00:01:21.514 --> 00:01:23.383
a similar pattern in Syria,

00:01:23.383 --> 00:01:24.050
where the Russians

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:25.785
were absolutely systematic

00:01:25.785 --> 00:01:27.253
about the destruction

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:28.588
of medical facilities.

00:01:28.588 --> 00:01:30.490
But this is also a civilian area

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:31.424
anyway, where

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:32.625
it's difficult to see at night.

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:33.493
But we're surrounded

00:01:33.493 --> 00:01:35.428
by residential buildings.

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:36.362
There's apartment

00:01:36.362 --> 00:01:36.896
block there

00:01:36.896 --> 00:01:38.398
there's several more over

00:01:38.398 --> 00:01:40.400
in that direction, Boris.

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:42.902
And because of the targeting of civilians

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:43.369
and above

00:01:43.369 --> 00:01:45.405
all, the targeting of a medical facility,

00:01:45.672 --> 00:01:46.673
the French government

00:01:46.673 --> 00:01:47.841
and no doubt other elements

00:01:47.841 --> 00:01:49.042
within the international community

00:01:49.042 --> 00:01:51.478
already describing this latest attack

00:01:51.478 --> 00:01:52.178
as a war crime,

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:54.314
which President Zelensky inevitably

00:01:54.547 --> 00:01:57.083
almost calls a terrorist crime.

00:01:57.283 --> 00:01:57.717
Boris.

00:01:58.751 --> 00:02:00.653
Yeah, the international community

00:02:00.653 --> 00:02:01.554
decrying this

00:02:01.554 --> 00:02:03.189
as a violation

00:02:03.189 --> 00:02:05.692
of international humanitarian law.

00:02:05.692 --> 00:02:06.326
Sam Kiley,

00:02:06.326 --> 00:02:07.894
thank you so much for that reporting.

00:02:07.894 --> 00:02:09.462
Let's get some perspective now

00:02:09.462 --> 00:02:10.597
from General Mark Hertling.

00:02:10.597 --> 00:02:12.132
He's a retired lieutenant general

00:02:12.132 --> 00:02:13.333
in the United States Army.

00:02:13.333 --> 00:02:15.668
Also a CNN military analyst.

00:02:15.668 --> 00:02:16.236
General Hertling,

00:02:16.236 --> 00:02:17.203
always great to see you.

00:02:17.203 --> 00:02:19.639
Appreciate your perspective, sir.

00:02:19.639 --> 00:02:21.241
Not the first time that we've seen

00:02:21.241 --> 00:02:22.408
Russia target

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:23.743
civilian infrastructure,

00:02:23.743 --> 00:02:26.613
but this attack specifically on a clinic

00:02:26.746 --> 00:02:28.748
a hospital that treats patients

00:02:28.748 --> 00:02:30.150
with mental illnesses.

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:32.552
This seems especially egregious

00:02:35.188 --> 00:02:36.356
It is porous.

00:02:36.356 --> 00:02:38.191
And when you take a look at the targeting

00:02:38.191 --> 00:02:40.193
that Russia has executed

00:02:40.193 --> 00:02:41.828
throughout this campaign,

00:02:41.828 --> 00:02:42.662
as you just said,

00:02:42.662 --> 00:02:45.298
they have targeted hospitals schools,

00:02:46.666 --> 00:02:48.168
civilian infrastructure,

00:02:48.168 --> 00:02:49.969
civilian apartment buildings

00:02:49.969 --> 00:02:50.770
with some of the most

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:52.705
devastating of weapon systems.

00:02:52.705 --> 00:02:53.139
You know, in

00:02:53.139 --> 00:02:55.909
just looking from afar at that building,

00:02:56.142 --> 00:02:59.012
that was £1,000 or greater bomb

00:02:59.012 --> 00:02:59.946
that hit that thing.

00:02:59.946 --> 00:03:02.148
It was a missile or a bomb or something.

00:03:02.148 --> 00:03:03.483
But it was huge.

00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:04.884
It wasn't just a small thing

00:03:04.884 --> 00:03:05.919
and it was purposeful

00:03:05.919 --> 00:03:07.120
because that hospital

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:08.922
is in the middle of a very large town

00:03:08.922 --> 00:03:09.956
to Dnipro.

00:03:09.956 --> 00:03:10.523
And again,

00:03:10.523 --> 00:03:12.192
it just summarizes

00:03:12.192 --> 00:03:13.927
the Russian way of war.

00:03:13.927 --> 00:03:14.794
As Sam said,

00:03:14.794 --> 00:03:15.328
they've done it

00:03:15.328 --> 00:03:17.197
before in Syria and Chechnya

00:03:17.197 --> 00:03:18.531
and all the other places

00:03:18.531 --> 00:03:19.499
they have fought.

00:03:19.499 --> 00:03:21.634
And it just exacerbates

00:03:21.634 --> 00:03:22.468
the suffering

00:03:22.468 --> 00:03:23.636
of the people of the country.

00:03:23.636 --> 00:03:24.737
They are growing up against.

00:03:25.838 --> 00:03:27.540
So in your mind,

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:29.475
how much does this sort of targeting

00:03:29.475 --> 00:03:30.910
have to do with the upcoming

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:32.412
Ukrainian counteroffensive

00:03:32.412 --> 00:03:34.214
that we've been anticipating now

00:03:34.214 --> 00:03:35.014
for some time?

00:03:35.014 --> 00:03:35.815
Is this

00:03:35.982 --> 00:03:37.350
potentially an act of desperation

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:38.384
or is just

00:03:39.152 --> 00:03:40.320
this just part of the standard

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:41.654
operating procedure

00:03:41.654 --> 00:03:43.923
of the Russian war machine?

00:03:44.924 --> 00:03:46.259
I personally don't

00:03:46.259 --> 00:03:47.627
I know a lot of people have been saying

00:03:47.627 --> 00:03:50.430
this is sort of Russia's way of of

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:52.065
actually

00:03:52.332 --> 00:03:55.201
trying to stop the offensive by Ukraine.

00:03:55.201 --> 00:03:56.202
I don't believe that

00:03:56.202 --> 00:03:57.503
they have been doing this

00:03:57.503 --> 00:03:59.239
since the beginning of the war.

00:03:59.239 --> 00:04:01.341
They have done this in every conflict

00:04:01.341 --> 00:04:03.343
they have been in in the 20th century

00:04:03.343 --> 00:04:05.278
since Mr. Putin has taken over.

00:04:05.278 --> 00:04:07.280
Again, our emphasize

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:09.349
it is the Russian way of war

00:04:09.349 --> 00:04:11.718
to purposely target civilians

00:04:11.884 --> 00:04:14.787
in violation of the Hague Convention

00:04:14.921 --> 00:04:16.522
and the Geneva protocols.

00:04:16.522 --> 00:04:18.958
So the president of Russia,

00:04:19.225 --> 00:04:20.493
his generals, whoever

00:04:20.493 --> 00:04:22.295
is deciding on these targeting

00:04:22.295 --> 00:04:24.530
are all guilty of war crimes, in my view.

00:04:25.632 --> 00:04:26.733
General, I also wanted

00:04:26.733 --> 00:04:26.966
to get

00:04:26.966 --> 00:04:28.301
your thoughts on the Dutch

00:04:28.301 --> 00:04:30.470
prime minister, Mark Ruta.

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:31.471
Today, he told journalists

00:04:31.471 --> 00:04:33.473
that the decision to send F-16

00:04:33.473 --> 00:04:35.074
fighter jets to Ukraine

00:04:35.074 --> 00:04:37.410
had not been finalized yet.

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:39.512
The Netherlands is supposed to lead

00:04:39.512 --> 00:04:41.981
the training mission on those jets.

00:04:42.148 --> 00:04:44.584
What do you make of his comments?

00:04:45.551 --> 00:04:47.854
Well, what we're looking at is both,

00:04:47.854 --> 00:04:49.455
I think, is a commitment,

00:04:49.455 --> 00:04:51.658
a long term commitment to Ukraine.

00:04:52.258 --> 00:04:53.960
This is what's been preempting

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:55.595
some of the weapons systems.

00:04:55.595 --> 00:04:57.330
Again, the focus has been on

00:04:57.330 --> 00:05:00.233
what can Ukraine put to use right now?

00:05:00.366 --> 00:05:02.602
What can they logistically support

00:05:02.769 --> 00:05:05.204
and what can the allies provide

00:05:05.204 --> 00:05:05.972
When you're talking

00:05:05.972 --> 00:05:07.740
about a complicated system.

00:05:07.740 --> 00:05:09.409
Certainly you can put a pilot

00:05:09.409 --> 00:05:10.843
in very quickly

00:05:10.843 --> 00:05:13.246
and teach them how to train the F-16.

00:05:13.446 --> 00:05:15.181
It's all the accompanying equipment,

00:05:15.181 --> 00:05:17.317
the supply, the support, the maintenance,

00:05:17.784 --> 00:05:19.085
the supply chain

00:05:19.085 --> 00:05:21.287
that is more and more difficult.

00:05:21.287 --> 00:05:24.190
So what you're seeing is a preparation

00:05:24.190 --> 00:05:25.425
for the future.

00:05:25.425 --> 00:05:26.659
Even with the announcement

00:05:26.659 --> 00:05:28.161
two weeks ago, I said,

00:05:28.161 --> 00:05:28.895
you know, it's great

00:05:28.895 --> 00:05:30.196
that there are some countries

00:05:30.196 --> 00:05:32.131
that are willing to give up F-16s,

00:05:32.131 --> 00:05:33.900
but it's going to take a long time

00:05:33.900 --> 00:05:34.967
and you're not going to see

00:05:34.967 --> 00:05:36.035
those aircraft

00:05:36.035 --> 00:05:37.737
in this upcoming offensive.

00:05:37.737 --> 00:05:39.105
Those will come later.

00:05:39.105 --> 00:05:40.440
But it is a signal

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:41.641
excuse me, a signal

00:05:41.641 --> 00:05:44.610
certainly to Russia that modernization

00:05:44.610 --> 00:05:46.579
of the Ukrainian military is coming

00:05:46.579 --> 00:05:48.648
and the West will continue to support.

00:05:49.716 --> 00:05:50.650
General Mark Hertling, we

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:51.751
have to leave the conversation there.

00:05:51.751 --> 00:05:52.852
Appreciate your analysis.

